    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Server</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/68e066d1c2a5b98e1ad58eb8286ed040.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/214339f69b1d2cdf6217331508adb10e.poster.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/214339f69b1d2cdf6217331508adb10e.webm?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/214339f69b1d2cdf6217331508adb10e.mp4?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dead Zone: Rebirth of Survivors is an FPS zombie-themed bullet hell game set in the Dead Zone universe. Fight against zombie hordes, improve your character with in-game improvements and skill tree training, and survive against bosses with various abilities. Kill and shred hordes of zombies! Gather skill points to improve your character. Use massive destruction guns to shred hordes of zombies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GORE! GOREE! GOREEE!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/83e478d6041883be7b38625bf772a4c1.poster.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/83e478d6041883be7b38625bf772a4c1.webm?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/83e478d6041883be7b38625bf772a4c1.mp4?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill &amp; Shred Hordes of Zombies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/1a71d76ae4e9e95b6255e4d532bab9b4.poster.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/1a71d76ae4e9e95b6255e4d532bab9b4.webm?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/1a71d76ae4e9e95b6255e4d532bab9b4.mp4?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Massive Destruction Guns!</h2>Such as a Rocket Launcher, Grenade Launcher, Frag Grenade, or Flamethrower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8767bb9df82b6f9948923ce722b2cd71.poster.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8767bb9df82b6f9948923ce722b2cd71.webm?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8767bb9df82b6f9948923ce722b2cd71.mp4?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Level up and get unique skills:</u> Each time you get leveled up while slaying zombies, you will get three choices to get an upgrade! These upgrades can make you find some associates, such as a Helicopter (for lighting the area and bombing zombies) or a Turret.<br></li><li> Every time you die, you earn experience based on your performance of slaying zombies. These experience points will give you skill tree points. You will use those skills to unlock new skills(active skills such as Grenade Launcher), guns and attachments, and buffs(passive skills such as +%10 Maximum HP)</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fight</h2>Each map comes with a unique boss! Gather associates and improve your character to survive against hordes of zombies and the bosses!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8d84d26ec0d8529cbe1fd32bb763fb4f.poster.avif?t=1747871409\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8d84d26ec0d8529cbe1fd32bb763fb4f.webm?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621280/extras/8d84d26ec0d8529cbe1fd32bb763fb4f.mp4?t=1747871409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Info About Dead Zone Universe!</h2></u><br>Dead Zone: Rebirth of Survivors is a bullet-hell game a part of the Dead Zone. DZ: RoS uses the base systems of Dead Zone. Dead Zone is an upcoming MMOFPS survival game that will be announced in Q3 2024. For more information, join our Discord server and ask anything you would like to know about DZ: RoS or Dead Zone.",
